794
00:32:42,248 --> 00:32:44,578
- I'm amazed. This is...
- Everything looks so tasty.

795
00:32:44,988 --> 00:32:46,218
- Let's dig in.
- Oh, my. It looks so good.

796
00:32:46,218 --> 00:32:48,958
