806
00:33:09,538 --> 00:33:11,108
(You Seok tries the wild rock seaweed pot rice too.)

807
00:33:11,778 --> 00:33:13,808
(Surprised and amazed)

808
00:33:14,678 --> 00:33:15,718
My goodness.

809
00:33:16,748 --> 00:33:18,288
This wild rock seaweed pot rice is so good.

810
00:33:19,648 --> 00:33:20,718
It's good.

811
00:33:20,988 --> 00:33:22,758
- The wild rock seaweed is tasty.
- It's tasty.

812
00:33:22,888 --> 00:33:24,828
(Right?)

813
00:33:25,458 --> 00:33:28,758
(The wild rock seaweed adds a nice crunch and a chewy texture.)

814
00:33:28,758 --> 00:33:30,928
Oh, it's rice with seaweed.

815
00:33:31,328 --> 00:33:33,498
(Crunchy, chewy)

816
00:33:33,828 --> 00:33:35,768
- It's so good.
- It's good, right?

817
00:33:35,768 --> 00:33:37,568
- Extra seaweed would've been nice.
- Yes.

818
00:33:37,998 --> 00:33:40,968
- It's not fishy at all.
- It's not fishy. It's savoury.

819
00:33:40,968 --> 00:33:41,978
It's so good.

820
00:33:42,678 --> 00:33:44,238
- It's good just as I thought.
- The seaweed we harvested.

821
00:33:44,238 --> 00:33:45,308
It's really precious.

822
00:33:47,148 --> 00:33:50,018
(The wild rock seaweed they harvested by themselves...)

823
00:33:50,718 --> 00:33:53,988
