829
00:34:08,838 --> 00:34:13,168
(It tastes even better that way!)

830
00:34:15,338 --> 00:34:17,938
(Yoon Seo tries Jung Ah's simple green onion yukgaejang too.)

831
00:34:18,278 --> 00:34:19,978
- The yukgaejang is so good.
- Is it good?

832
00:34:19,978 --> 00:34:21,048
It's good.

833
00:34:21,448 --> 00:34:24,048
