846
00:35:04,818 --> 00:35:07,588
(Exclaiming in awe)

847
00:35:08,558 --> 00:35:13,568
(She takes a bite of the combination of the pot rice and yukgaejang.)

848
00:35:14,198 --> 00:35:16,798
(It's so tasty.)

849
00:35:17,998 --> 00:35:20,708
