850
00:35:21,538 --> 00:35:23,238
(Munching)

851
00:35:23,638 --> 00:35:24,838
(This is really something.)

852
00:35:25,108 --> 00:35:26,178
It's good.

853
00:35:28,378 --> 00:35:32,118
