854
00:35:32,718 --> 00:35:35,918
(make him fall in love with the green onion yukgaejang.)

855
00:35:37,058 --> 00:35:39,788
(I'm glad I made green onion yukgaejang.)

856
00:35:40,628 --> 00:35:43,728
I usually eat more side dishes than rice.

857
00:35:43,728 --> 00:35:45,768
- I see.
- But I can't stop eating the rice.

858
00:35:47,028 --> 00:35:50,868
(The perfect combination of savoury wild rock seaweed pot rice...)

859
00:35:50,868 --> 00:35:53,568
(and spicy green onion yukgaejang...)

860
00:35:55,538 --> 00:35:59,278
