861
00:35:59,808 --> 00:36:00,878
My, it's tasty.

862
00:36:03,218 --> 00:36:05,948
(The food that Jung Ah made with so much love and effort...)

863
00:36:06,788 --> 00:36:12,358
(provides a hearty breakfast that keeps everyone full.)

864
00:36:12,658 --> 00:36:13,758
What's the plan for the curry contest?

865
00:36:14,858 --> 00:36:17,828
