874
00:36:39,218 --> 00:36:41,618
- You adjusted the saltiness, right?
- Yes.

875
00:36:42,558 --> 00:36:45,058
(Hae Joon takes this opportunity to get a feel for Jung Ah's palate.)

876
00:36:45,558 --> 00:36:46,928
We need to remember this exact level of saltiness.

877
00:36:47,288 --> 00:36:49,758
