- To figure out my preference?

878
00:36:49,758 --> 00:36:51,058
(You need to find out her baseline for saltiness.)

879
00:36:51,768 --> 00:36:53,368
So we need to make our curry based on that.

880
00:36:53,898 --> 00:36:55,768
- He's very competitive.
- Yes.

881
00:36:56,368 --> 00:36:58,608
(Jung Ah seems astonished by his competitiveness.)

882
00:36:59,168 --> 00:37:02,908
(The other contestants start keeping him in check.)

883
00:37:03,608 --> 00:37:05,808
(It won't be easy, Father.)

884
00:37:06,648 --> 00:37:08,378
We'll begin the curry showdown.

885
00:37:09,848 --> 00:37:10,918
I'm nervous.

886
00:37:10,918 --> 00:37:11,948
(The 1st Siblings' Curry Showdown)

887
00:37:11,948 --> 00:37:14,218
My usual recipe for curry is amazing.

888
00:37:14,718 --> 00:37:16,958
My recipe is not that plain.

889
00:37:18,088 --> 00:37:20,058
(They're out to win over the palate of Jung Ah, the judge.)

890
00:37:20,728 --> 00:37:22,458
I watched many videos on YouTube.

891
00:37:22,698 --> 00:37:25,298
I can make curry with my eyes closed.

892
00:37:26,068 --> 00:37:27,798
So this is what it's like to be on a competition show.

893
00:37:27,798 --> 00:37:29,598
(Who will be the winner of the cooking contest?)

894
00:37:30,298 --> 00:37:31,498
Guys, they want us...

895
00:37:31,498 --> 00:37:32,668
- to sit on the wooden bench.
- Sorry?

896
00:37:32,668 --> 00:37:34,868
- We should sit on the wooden bench.
- Are we having a crisis meeting?

897
00:37:37,838 --> 00:37:39,248
Go ahead.

898
00:37:39,248 --> 00:37:42,518
We'll begin the curry showdown shortly.

899
00:37:42,518 --> 00:37:43,518
- Yes.
- Yes.

900
00:37:43,518 --> 00:37:46,048
You see, Tongyeong and Geoje...

901
00:37:46,048 --> 00:37:47,848
- produce a lot of great crops.
- I see.

902
00:37:50,258 --> 00:37:54,328
