903
00:37:54,328 --> 00:37:56,558
(in the fertile soil of Tongyeong and Geoje.)

904
00:37:59,198 --> 00:38:01,428
So we thought it'd be meaningful...

905
00:38:01,428 --> 00:38:04,038
