909
00:38:12,278 --> 00:38:13,578
- Okay.
- I see. Understood.

910
00:38:13,748 --> 00:38:15,008
(I think it's a great idea.)

911
00:38:15,318 --> 00:38:17,718
Everyone except for Jung Ah...

912
00:38:17,718 --> 00:38:19,448
- will draw their ingredients...
- They will draw their ingredients.

913
00:38:19,448 --> 00:38:22,388
- and use them to make their curry.
- I see.

914
00:38:23,118 --> 00:38:24,158
Shall we begin now?

915
00:38:24,158 --> 00:38:25,158
(Excited)

916
00:38:25,488 --> 00:38:26,488
Hae Joon, you go first.

917
00:38:27,358 --> 00:38:28,828
Just pick 1, not 2.

918
00:38:28,828 --> 00:38:29,898
(She keeps him in check.)

919
00:38:30,798 --> 00:38:31,968
(Looking at the others nervously)

920
00:38:32,268 --> 00:38:34,398
(Choosing carefully)

921
00:38:35,768 --> 00:38:38,298
- Okay.
- Let's reveal our ingredients.

922
00:38:39,468 --> 00:38:41,538
- One, two, three.
- Two, three.

923
00:38:42,678 --> 00:38:44,408
Onion.

924
00:38:44,838 --> 00:38:46,278
(Yoon Seo: Onion)

925
00:38:46,978 --> 00:38:49,318
Potato. What? I think she got a bad one.

926
00:38:50,118 --> 00:38:51,148
- Onion.
- What?

927
00:38:51,818 --> 00:38:52,818
(Onion, potato)

928
00:38:52,818 --> 00:38:55,258
