931
00:39:01,488 --> 00:39:02,758
- Really?
- So that's why...

932
00:39:02,758 --> 00:39:04,028
- there were only two crops.
- It must be really delicious.

933
00:39:04,028 --> 00:39:07,068
You can go to the village hall to receive the ingredients...

934
00:39:07,168 --> 00:39:09,738
