935
00:39:09,738 --> 00:39:11,068
- I see.
- Right now?

936
00:39:11,068 --> 00:39:12,068
- Yes.
- Got it.

937
00:39:12,068 --> 00:39:13,108
- Okay.
- Got it.

938
00:39:13,108 --> 00:39:16,738
We should dress up nicely since we'll meet the locals.

939
00:39:17,278 --> 00:39:19,848
- Should we sing a song for them?
- No, we...

940
00:39:20,448 --> 00:39:21,648
Should we sing as we enter the village hall?

941
00:39:22,718 --> 00:39:25,288
- You just have to bring the crops.
- Yes.

942
00:39:25,288 --> 00:39:27,718
- Greet and thank them politely.
- We'll bow to them.

943
00:39:27,848 --> 00:39:28,858
(Polite)

944
00:39:28,858 --> 00:39:30,258
- Of course, we'll do that.
- We'll wish them a happy new year.

945
00:39:32,228 --> 00:39:33,488
By the way, are we going there empty-handed?

946
00:39:33,928 --> 00:39:36,058
Oh, right. We're going there empty-handed.

947
00:39:36,458 --> 00:39:38,498
Shouldn't we give them something in return?

948
00:39:38,928 --> 00:39:40,768
- Shall we give them the curry?
- Oh, the curry?

949
00:39:40,768 --> 00:39:41,828
(Taken aback)

950
00:39:42,168 --> 00:39:43,938
- I hope it's good enough to eat.
- Right.

951
00:39:44,298 --> 00:39:46,868
- I hope it's delicious.
- I hope it's good enough to eat.

952
00:39:46,868 --> 00:39:47,938
What if it's not good?

953
00:39:50,038 --> 00:39:52,708
- We'll give them some if it's okay.
- But is curry enough for a gift?

954
00:39:53,608 --> 00:39:54,608
And if not...

955
00:39:55,178 --> 00:39:56,678
(Worried)

956
00:39:56,678 --> 00:39:57,748
I'm worried.

957
00:39:59,348 --> 00:40:01,188
