958
00:40:01,488 --> 00:40:02,888
- Let's get going.
- Go on.

959
00:40:02,888 --> 00:40:04,658
- See you later.
- See you later.

960
00:40:04,658 --> 00:40:07,388
- Jung Ah, we'll be back shortly.
- I'll leave this here.

961
00:40:11,198 --> 00:40:13,068
Yoon Seo, you look like the Little Match Girl.

962
00:40:13,328 --> 00:40:14,668
Why is your shirt buttoned up in the back?

963
00:40:15,568 --> 00:40:17,598
Oh, this? It has buttons in the back.

964
00:40:17,598 --> 00:40:18,908
