965
00:40:19,168 --> 00:40:20,668
- Oh, this shirt is...
- It's unique.

966
00:40:20,938 --> 00:40:22,578
Please give me some onions.

967
00:40:23,008 --> 00:40:24,238
Young man, where are you headed?

968
00:40:25,038 --> 00:40:26,478
- Come this way.
- The village hall.

969
00:40:27,008 --> 00:40:28,048
Are you heading to the village hall?

970
00:40:28,048 --> 00:40:29,118
- Yes.
- Yes.

971
00:40:31,818 --> 00:40:33,518
- What was its name? Haru?
- Haru?

972
00:40:33,748 --> 00:40:34,788
I heard its name. Is it Haneul?

973
00:40:35,858 --> 00:40:39,058
