974
00:40:39,488 --> 00:40:42,298
- This young man said...
- Ninety-two.

975
00:40:42,428 --> 00:40:44,058
- he wasn't married.
- Ninety-two.

976
00:40:45,198 --> 00:40:46,868
Oh, my. We're here. This is the village hall.

977
00:40:47,568 --> 00:40:51,198
