978
00:40:52,468 --> 00:40:54,108
- This is it, right? The entrance...
- My goodness.

979
00:40:54,108 --> 00:40:55,738
- It says "potato." Gosh.
- "Potato?"

980
00:40:55,738 --> 00:40:56,938
