2561
01:43:29,921 --> 01:43:31,151
Do You Know Hidden.

2562
01:43:32,181 --> 01:43:33,421
Yoon Seo placed third?

2563
01:43:33,421 --> 01:43:36,221
(Underdog, Do You Know Hidden)

2564
01:43:36,221 --> 01:43:38,321
- Yoon Seo placed third?
- Hurry up and announce it.

2565
01:43:38,321 --> 01:43:39,531
Yoon Seo's curry was so good.

2566
01:43:40,791 --> 01:43:42,061
Yoon Seo placed third?

2567
01:43:42,061 --> 01:43:45,201
- Hurry up and announce it.
- Yoon Seo's curry was so good.

2568
01:43:45,201 --> 01:43:46,331
Please announce it already.

2569
01:43:46,331 --> 01:43:48,271
(Do You Know Hidden, a total of 76 points)

2570
01:43:48,601 --> 01:43:50,541
