2660
01:47:41,471 --> 01:47:43,501
I hope the three of you blend well together.

2661
01:47:45,101 --> 01:47:46,711
(Oops)

2662
01:47:47,211 --> 01:47:49,641
(It's an unintended roast.)

2663
01:47:50,141 --> 01:47:51,881
- You're so funny, Sun Young.
- Then our curry...

2664
01:47:52,581 --> 01:47:53,611
I'm never...

2665
01:47:54,451 --> 01:47:55,951
coming back here again.

2666
01:47:58,321 --> 01:48:00,991
