2667
01:48:00,991 --> 01:48:04,021
It's perfect for the show. I mean...

2668
01:48:04,761 --> 01:48:05,861
What is he saying?

2669
01:48:05,961 --> 01:48:07,591
It's in line with the concept of the show.

2670
01:48:08,161 --> 01:48:09,291
Let's have another cooking showdown.

2671
01:48:10,101 --> 01:48:11,961
Yes, I like the idea.

2672
01:48:11,961 --> 01:48:13,201
- Don't you agree?
- Yes.

2673
01:48:13,201 --> 01:48:15,171
- This is so much fun.
- I'm confident I can win next time.

2674
01:48:15,171 --> 01:48:16,271
You'll make another dish.

2675
01:48:16,671 --> 01:48:17,841
- Let's make another dish.
- What's the dish?

2676
01:48:17,841 --> 01:48:19,001
I figured out everyone's taste.

2677
01:48:19,341 --> 01:48:20,511
Hae Joon, do it with us one more time.

2678
01:48:21,071 --> 01:48:23,211
- You should come back.
- Come on, Hae Joon.

2679
01:48:23,211 --> 01:48:24,241
