2686
01:48:40,191 --> 01:48:41,261
(Screaming with excitement)

2687
01:48:41,261 --> 01:48:42,591
(That's awesome.)

2688
01:48:42,591 --> 01:48:44,661
(Rock?)

2689
01:48:44,801 --> 01:48:45,801
(Can we watch the concerts?)

2690
01:48:45,801 --> 01:48:47,471
