2722
01:50:07,181 --> 01:50:10,051
(Siblings' Chinese Restaurant is now open.)

2723
01:50:10,921 --> 01:50:12,681
(The table will be packed with the finest Chinese cuisine.)

2724
01:50:12,991 --> 01:50:13,991
(It's better than the dishes at Chinese restaurants.)

2725
01:50:14,421 --> 01:50:16,251
(This Chinese restaurant serves great food.)

2726
01:50:16,661 --> 01:50:18,091
(He instantly falls in love.)

2727
01:50:18,461 --> 01:50:19,961
(The oldest member is satisfied.)

2728
01:50:20,091 --> 01:50:21,861
